This Flatpak also holds libsensors, the library of lm-sensors
(LGPL-2.1-or-later), built from the lm-sensors tag @LMS_TAG@, commit
@LMS_COMMIT@, with one change: the patch
flatpak/lm-sensors-quiet-sysfs-root.patch, which removes one warning
message of lib/sysfs.c. Its complete source is in the same archive:
the directory lm-sensors-@LMS_TAG@, with that patch in the directory
flatpak; the tag is also at https://github.com/lm-sensors/lm-sensors
and the patch in Puron's public repository. The programs load it as a
shared library, /app/lib/libsensors.so.5, which a user can replace.
